{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/80684-stripped-the-comics-documentary","id":80684,"title":"STRIPPED: the Comics Documentary","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-26T18:29:08-08:00","id":80684,"title":"STRIPPED: the Comics Documentary","content":"Ok, I'm recommending this documentary here for a couple reasons. This is the first Kickstarter project I ever backed, and the one that's taken the longest to complete (<i>over two years!</i>), so I've got a lot of built-up excitement. Also, I'd imagine the subject matter is something folks around here would be interested in.<br /> <br /> Here are some links:<br /> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/smallfish/stripped-the-comics-documentary\" target=\"_blank\">The Kickstarter Page with full details about the project!</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.washingtonpost.com/news/comic-riffs/wp/2014/02/26/bill-watterson-talks-for-documentary-cartoonist-offers-his-first-public-cartoon-since-ending-calvin-and-hobbes/\" target=\"_blank\">A Washington Post article about how BILL WATTERSON did the Movie Poster!</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/movie/stripped/id816065098?ls=1\" target=\"_blank\">The iTunes Link where you can pre-order a digital copy!</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/strippedfilm\" target=\"_blank\">The STRIPPED Twitter account for more news!</a><br /> <br /> <br /> So what's the deal? Here's the plot summary from the iTunes page:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> \u201cStripped\u201d is a feature-length documentary on comic strips, how they\u2019re created, and the people behind them - featuring the first-ever recorded interview with Bill Watterson of Calvin &amp; Hobbes. The film sits down with over 60 of the world\u2019s best cartoonists to talk about comic strips, where the art form\u2019s going, and what happens to it as newspapers die and digital takes off. Featured interviews include: Cathy Guisewite (Cathy), Lynn Johnston (For Better or For Worse), Mort Walker (Beetle Bailey), Mike &amp; Jerry (Penny Arcade), Matt Inman (The Oatmeal), Kate Beaton (Hark! A Vagrant) and Patrick McDonnell (Mutts). Set to original music by Stefan Lessard of Dave Matthews Band, the film is a must-see for comics fans. </div> </div> </div>Now, the goal is to spike first-day sales as much as possible. When the &quot;Machine of Death&quot; Short Story anthology released, the creators were able to organize their fans and make sales soar all the way to the top of the Amazon New Book sales for a day... which coincidentally made Glenn Beck devote half an episode to the &quot;Liberal Suicide Cult Conspiracy&quot; that prevented his own new book from securing that honor on the same day. While STRIPPED's projected release doesn't seem poised to butt heads with anyone like that, it would still be pretty rad to get the sales numbers way up there. iTunes pre-orders will be counted towards First Day Sales, so that's why they want us channeling people towards that link.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I'm a backer, and get my digital download a little while before the &quot;street date&quot;, so I'll be able to let you know if it sucks (IT WON'T) so you could back out of the pre-order too. So no risk!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please add signature.","edited":{"userid":615,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/615-the-hanged-man","user":"The Hanged Man","date":". 02-26-2014, 09:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/615-the-hanged-man","name":"The Hanged Man","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"288"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}